### List users
GET http://localhost:3000/users HTTP/1.1

### test route
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test HTTP/1.1

### Register users
POST http://localhost:3000/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Harshana Wijeisnghe",
    "birthDate": "1997/04/12",
    "NIC": "199710301450",
    "contactNo": "768945884",
    "division": "Division 1",
    "gnDivision": "Gn Division 1",
    "employment": "Yes",
    "willingToContribute": "Yes",
    "specialAbilities": "No",
    "comingToYouthSummit": "No",
    "gnDivisionCount": "0",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-15",
    "isRegistered": false
}

### Attend users
POST http://localhost:3000/attendance HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "1",
    "fullName": "Harshana Wijesinghe",
    "contactNo": "768945884"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/attendance/all HTTP/1:1

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/attendance?id=1 HTTP/1:1

### Google sheet response - query
GET http://localhost:3000/responses?take=15&skip=0 HTTP/1.1

### Google sheet response - all
GET http://localhost:3000/responses/all HTTP/1.1

